[en.FOCUS_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK]
New Textbook A

[en.FOCUS_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK_desc]
The proposal of modern magic theory has brought the study of magic into a new era. In order to adapt to this change, the Empire Ministry of Education has decided to develop a new magic textbook to meet the new teaching needs.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK]
新教科书A

[zh.FOCUS_C01_NEW_TEXTBOOK_desc]
近代魔法理论的提出，使得魔法学科的研究进入了一个新的时代。为了适应这一变化，帝国教育部决定制定新的魔法教科书，以适应新的教学需求。

